   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Thanks! Took me, like, an hour just to figure out which side of the dress was the front.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1386017949": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -909540676,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Happy to be here, more than you might think...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "775125957": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hah, well, yeah! He doesn’t talk down to me, and he listens. Kinda rare, y’know? Plus he’s funny when he tries to act cool.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1413330667": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 159056251,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hey, I mean... He's just speaking his mind! Haha!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1006810862": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Was this your idea, or... someone's suggestion?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1363750145": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Wait, is that a metaphor? Or like, a dress metaphor? I’m not sure.",
